SKS = [('Short bow (replaces sling or javelins)', 1), ('Bow (replaces sling or javelins)', 2), ('Shield (replaces buckler)', 0), ('Riding Camels', 1), ('Solenarion (two units; Abbasid, Hamdanid, Fatimid; +3 pts)', 3)]
EC.append(U(INF, 'Guard Skirmishers', [M('Guard Skirmisher', '4 3 3 3 3 1 3 1 7', 7, mn=5, weapons=['Hand Weapon', 'Buckler', 'Sling'], rules=['Light Troops'], options=copy.deepcopy(SKS) + [('Throwing spear (replaces javelins or slings)', 1), ('Javelins (replaces sling)', 0)])],
    'Hand weapon, buckler & sling or javelins. May exchange sling or javelins for short bow (+1 pt), bow (+2 pts), and exchange buckler for shield (free). May be Riding Camels (+1 pt). Guards may exchange javelins or slings for throwing spear (+1 pt). Solenarion Option: in Abbasid, Hamdanid and Fatimid armies, two units may replace sling or javelins with Solenarion (+3 pts). Guards are Light Infantry. Light Troop models with bows may not outnumber Light Troop models armed with other weapons. 0-2 units.', mx=2, page='83'))
